{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17108289","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17108289","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1710828901:1":{"text":"Captain! Thank Dura, we got them through!","source_cn":"队长！感谢艾雅，您把大家都带出来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8A3EAF4DEBE58FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710828902:1":{"text":"We've fortified the theater perimeter. The monsters won't break through anytime soon.","source_cn":"我们在剧场附近设置了路障，魔物一时半会儿攻不上来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x069E854001C3AC80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710828903:1":{"text":"Good. Tend to the wounded.","source_cn":"很好。受伤的民众记得安排治疗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFCAC7260D0EF187","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710828904:1":{"text":"Understood. But... there's another emergency.","source_cn":"请您放心。但是……队长，还有一个紧急情况——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x263FC1AA5D4F893C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710828905:1":{"text":"Distress signals just came in.","source_cn":"刚刚收到求救信号，在广场西南侧和圣古堂前的桥上，还有两...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x859336B39076C7BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710828906:1":{"text":"Two groups are trapped—southwest of the plaza, and on the bridge before the Hall of Ancients.","source_cn":"我们主要的兵力现在都集中在这里维持防线，要是分兵去救的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3EFE5D475F56633","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710828907:1":{"text":"Most forces are holding here. If we split to rescue them...","source_cn":"这里的防线不能动。如果分散兵力，这里的民众也会失去保护。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7858E76E125D693D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710828908:1":{"text":"The line holds here. If it breaks, these civilians are exposed. I'll retrieve both groups myself.","source_cn":"广场南侧和圣古堂前的桥上，那两处的民众，我去带他们回来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3543581CFF7FF6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710828909:1":{"text":"But Captain, you've already...","source_cn":"可是队长！您的体力……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22046CB9B01B9760","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710828910:1":{"text":"That's an order. Hold this position. I'll return shortly!","source_cn":"执行命令，你们守好这里！我去去就回。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE69DCE14C1D55C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710828911:1":{"text":"Yes, Captain!","source_cn":"遵命，队长！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8421DB761BFA987","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710828912:1":{"text":"Understood, Captain!","source_cn":"是！队长！<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9201AB00422EA311","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:守备军加雷斯":{"text":"Guard Gareswell","source":"守备军加雷斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"Gwyneth","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:守备军马丁":{"text":"Guard Martin","source":"守备军马丁","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":3}}